@segment  campfire-calling
@title    Astral Campfire — Calling
@levels   F15
@shelved  source session removed by user on 2026-08-22
@duration ~1m30s

say As you sit, breathe into your chest. On the exhale, let the light of the campfire brighten, just a little.
pause 8
say You are sending a signal. Not with words, but with presence.
pause 5
say Say inwardly. I am here. I welcome connection.
pause 8
say Your flame glows softly in answer. Others may see it, feel it, sense it.
pause 5
say Let this signal radiate out into the surrounding area.
pause 10
